# Chunk-Based Video Processing Implementation Plan (v2)

## Goal Description

Implement a robust, multi-level chunking pipeline for video translation that addresses:
- Memory/timeout issues with large files
- STT accuracy (Whisper optimized for ~30s windows)
- Boundary continuity (text, audio, video)
- Failure isolation and recoverability
- Quality signals for confidence-based retries

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Chunk Durations (Configurable)**
> - Video chunk: 300s (5 min)
> - Audio sub-chunk: 30s (optimal for Whisper)
> - Audio overlap: 1.5s (for boundary deduplication)

> [!WARNING]
> **Breaking Change**: The pipeline output structure will change. Each job will now have a `chunks/` subdirectory with per-chunk artifacts.

---

## Pipeline Architecture

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Video Input] --> B[split_video 300s]
    B --> C[Chunk 1]
    B --> D[Chunk 2]
    B --> E[Chunk N...]
    
    subgraph ChunkProcessing["Per-Chunk Processing"]
        C --> F[extract_audio]
        F --> G[split_audio 30s + 1.5s overlap]
        G --> H[STT with confidence]
        H --> I[text_dedup_merge]
        I --> J[Local RAG]
        J --> K[Translation]
        K --> L[TTS]
        L --> M[chunk_tts.wav]
    end
    
    M --> N[Timeline-Aware Audio Merge]
    N --> O[Video Reconstruction]
    O --> P[Validation Checks]
    P --> Q[Safe Cleanup]
    Q --> R[Final Video]
```

