### modules

#### [MODIFY] [video_processor.py](file:///home/muruga/workspace/ccp_sem6/ccpmerging/ccpnew/modules/video_processor.py)
Add methods:
- `split_video(video_path, duration, overlap=0) -> List[Path]`
  - Splits video into chunks with optional overlap
  - Returns list of chunk paths
- `split_audio(audio_path, duration, overlap) -> List[Tuple[Path, float, float]]`
  - Splits audio into sub-chunks for STT
  - Returns list of (path, start_time, end_time)
- `merge_audios_timeline(audio_chunks, timestamps, output_path, crossfade_ms=50) -> Path`
  - Timeline-aware merge with crossfade
  - Validates duration continuity
  - Handles silence gaps

