## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
1. **Duration validation**: `merged_audio_duration ≈ sum(chunk_durations) - overlaps`
2. **Timestamp regression check**: No segment has `start > end` or overlaps incorrectly
3. **Text continuity score**: Measure perplexity/coherence across chunk boundaries
4. **Confidence thresholds**: Flag chunks with `avg_logprob < -1.0` or `no_speech_prob > 0.5`

### Manual Verification
- Test with a 10+ minute video
- Compare output quality vs non-chunked processing
- Verify retry works for failed chunks

---

## Directory Schema

```
job_<uuid>/
├── chunks/
│   ├── chunk_000/
│   │   ├── video.mp4
│   │   ├── audio.wav
│   │   ├── audio_subchunks/
│   │   │   ├── subchunk_000.wav
│   │   │   ├── subchunk_001.wav
│   │   │   └── ...
│   │   ├── frames/
│   │   ├── stt.json           # with confidence metadata
│   │   ├── translation.json
│   │   ├── tts.wav
│   │   └── status.json
│   ├── chunk_001/
│   │   └── ...
│   └── ...
├── global_rag.json
├── merged_audio.wav
├── final_video.mp4
├── validation.json
└── manifest.json
```

---

## Summary of Improvements

| Issue | Solution |
|-------|----------|
| Long audio chunks | Audio sub-chunking (30s windows) |
| Sentence boundary slicing | Overlap + deduplication |
| Context loss across chunks | Context carryover (last sentence) |
| RAG noise per chunk | Hierarchical RAG (global → local) |
| No failure recovery | Idempotent chunks with status.json |
| Simple audio merge | Timeline-aware merge with crossfade |
| No quality signals | Confidence scores from Whisper |
| Unsafe cleanup | Cleanup only after final_video.success |
